<BaseLayout breadcrumbLabel="Quality & measurement" title="Automated CMM inspection and quality workflows | PCam" description="Integrate CMM programming, electrode preset, workpiece inspection and automated quality workflows into tool and mould production.">
<ApplicationDetail eyebrow="Application · Quality" title="Keep measurement from becoming the next bottleneck." lead="As machining becomes more autonomous, CMM preparation and inspection must become faster, more repeatable and better connected to the part or electrode being produced." symptoms={['CMM programming consumes too much expert time','Inspection queues grow as machining capacity increases','Electrode preset and quality checks are manual','Measurement results are disconnected from the production route','Automated cells stop before or after the CMM step']} designPrinciples={[{title:'Program from the model',text:'Use solid geometry as the common source for measurement intent.'},{title:'Automate repeatable setup',text:'Preset and inspection routines should minimize manual datum work.'},{title:'Keep identity through inspection',text:'The measured object and digital job must remain linked.'},{title:'Integrate material handling',text:'CMM loading should be another controlled process step when appropriate.'},{title:'Return useful results',text:'Measurement should generate actionable state and reporting.'},{title:'Protect metrology rigor',text:'Automation must not simplify away the measurement standards the process depends on.'}]} workflow={[{title:'Solid model',text:'Nominal geometry'},{title:'PCamMMS',text:'Measurement definition and path'},{title:'CMM',text:'Inspection execution'},{title:'Production',text:'Result, traceability and next step'}]} productSlugs={['pcammms','pcamcell','pcammes']} proofSlugs={['sfs-monitoring']} />
</BaseLayout>
